# M18 "Kuşanma" (docs/PROTOCOL_EQUIPMENT.md §6), flow "m18_swing" run "warrior" (Ortaocak; MonsterAttack = 25): a
# level-1 warrior fights a Kül Çömezi with the kit's sword (1600 ms: a ~0.67 s swing, state swingmedium), then
# equips the kit's two-handed Ocak Baltası (2200 ms, x1.375 per swing: a ~0.92 s swing, swingslow) and fights the
# next one. Each weapon: a burst of close side views through one swing; the combat log prints the swing tempo
# and the gap the server kept between two swings.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m18_swing_w
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Savurgan
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene expectderived speed 1.6
scene expectderived reach 2.5
waitfor world+monsters 600
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+swings2+swingmedium 900
scene camera side 6 2.2
waitfor world+swings3 300
screenshot 01_sword_swing_a.png
wait 6
screenshot 02_sword_swing_b.png
wait 6
screenshot 03_sword_swing_c.png
wait 6
screenshot 04_sword_swing_d.png
scene combatlog
waitfor world+kills1 1800
wait 30
# The two-handed axe: the shield goes to the bag.
scene itemmove bag0 main
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene expectequip main 6 off 0
wait 40
scene expectderived speed 2.2
scene expectderived reach 2.7
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+swingslow 900
wait 40
scene camera side 6 2.2
wait 2
screenshot 05_axe_swing_a.png
wait 6
screenshot 06_axe_swing_b.png
wait 6
screenshot 07_axe_swing_c.png
wait 6
screenshot 08_axe_swing_d.png
scene combatlog
waitfor world+kills2 1800
scene combatlog
quit
